Sample material
---------------
docs/samples/ and worker/tests/fixtures/samples/ contain test material derived from two
publicly available Process Validation Protocol documents, included solely to develop and test
the example document type:

  * "TEXT process_validation_protocol.pdf": excerpt (5 of 24 pages) of the gmpsop.com
    template TEM-290. Placeholders only, no executed results.
  * worker/tests/fixtures/samples/pvp-image-ocr.json: OCR text of a publicly available
    Safetab Life Science "protocol cum report" (PVP/23/003-01).

These documents remain the property of their respective owners. See docs/samples/README.md.
